index(domain,entity,field,path,objectLocation,moduleName,moduleContent) ::= <<
# Rust Assist — Internationalization
Parse the generated `teaql-i18n.json` catalog, install it explicitly on `context`, and call `context.set_locale_code(code)` before checker execution. Preserve the typed `UnsupportedLocale` error and do not change the active locale when parsing fails. Translate display messages without changing rule ids.

>>
